{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 365, "line_no": 2, "text": "清晨这段时间自然界的景物变化，意境很优美。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 245, "w": 824, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "清晨这段时间自然界的景物变化，意境很优美。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 245, "w": 824, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 365, "line_no": 3, "text": "此外，摩经文学中的对比、比拟、象征等手法也具有鲜明的特点。这里举摩经情歌", "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 310, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "此外，摩经文学中的对比、比拟、象征等手法也具有鲜明的特点。这里举摩经情歌", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 201, "y": 310, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 365, "line_no": 4, "text": "例。比如贞丰摩经中有这么一段：", "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 374, "w": 591, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "例。比如贞丰摩经中有这么一段：", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 121, "y": 374, "w": 591, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 365, "line_no": 5, "text": "口口声声说我不思，", "bbox_px": {"x": 446, "y": 507, "w": 346, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "口口声声说我不思，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 446, "y": 507, "w": 346, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
